sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant A as API / scope
  participant R as Retrieval
  participant S as Sources
  participant M as Model / verifier
  U->>A: Question + authenticated session
  A->>R: Search with server-enforced scope
  R->>A: Candidate IDs / ranks / versions
  A->>S: Fetch applicable authorized chunks
  S->>A: Original evidence + citation references
  A->>M: Bounded source blocks + question
  M->>M: Draft then check material claims
  M->>A: Supported answer or explicit gaps
  A->>U: Release verified result
